    "description": "Sri Lankan Airlines Airbus Scandal and the Death of Kapila Chandrasena and my Brother Rajeewa",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/sri-lankan-airlines-airbus-scandal-and-the-death-of-kapila-chandrasena-and-my-brother-rajeewa/",
