    "chunk_text": "Medihelp Hospitals opens new facility in Kiribathgoda\n\nMedihelp Hospitals has opened a new healthcare facility in Kiribathgoda, marking a meaningful return to where the organization first began as a diagnostic lab in 1979.\n\nThe branch offers OPD, ETU, channeling, lab diagnostics, radiology, ultrasound, and echocardiography under one roof\u2014addressing a long-standing lack of comprehensive private healthcare in the area.\n\n\u201cWe are proud to open a Medihelp branch in Kiribathgoda\u2014the very place where our journey began,\u201d said Managing Director Chandika Wijesiriwardana.\n\nThe inauguration was attended by Minister Dr. Upali Pannilage and Kelaniya Pradeshiya Sabha Chairman Dr. Sandun Yapa Karunaratna. Medihelp plans to further expand into underserved towns like Kadawatha, reinforcing its mission to make quality, accessible healthcare available to all Sri Lankans.\n\nCeylinco Life donates medical gas system to teaching hospital Kalutara\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
