    "description": "Opposition accuses Tilvin Silva of undermining coal probe Presidential Commission",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Opposition-accuses-Tilvin-Silva-of-undermining-coal-probe-Presidential-Commission/56-792168",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
