    "description": "The Quiet Shift: China as America\u2019s \u201c+1\u201d in a Changing World Order",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/the-quiet-shift-china-as-americas-1-in-a-changing-world-order/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
