    "chunk_size_bytes": 752,
    "chunk_text": "The meeting was attended by the NCE President Indhra Kaushal Rajapaksa, and the Secretary General/Chief Executive Officer Shiham Marikar accompanied by representatives of member organisations comprising established exporters and key service sector stakeholders, including logistics providers, financial institutions, insurance companies, certification bodies, and port terminal operators etc.\n\nThis initiative aligns with the ongoing efforts of the EDB to promote export-oriented enterprises and enhance their contribution to national exports and the collaboration between the EDB and the NCE reflects a shared commitment to strengthening Sri Lankan exporters through strategic institutional partnerships and sustainable Export Development initiatives."
