    "md5": "6c62ff4b72c05be218f5843b9ffb5115",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1865,
    "chunk_text": "Fentons IT hosts exclusive CIO cocktail networking evening with IceWarp\n\nFentons IT (FIT), in partnership with IceWarp, recently hosted an exclusive CIO (Chief Information Officers) networking cocktail evening titled \u201cThe IceBreaker Moment,\u201d bringing together senior IT leaders from Sri Lanka\u2019s leading organisations.\n\nHeld on 24 April at SHARK by Port City, the event was designed as a relaxed, open-air gathering, moving away from traditional corporate formats to encourage meaningful conversations and authentic engagement. The audience included CIOs and technology decision-makers from over 40 organisations, primarily across the BFSI sector, alongside telecom, manufacturing, and diversified conglomerates.\n\nThe evening offered attendees a valuable opportunity to interact directly with IceWarp\u2019s global leadership beyond traditional formal settings, encouraging more open and meaningful engagement, dialogue, and knowledge sharing.\n\nThe two-hour event featured interactive activities including the IceWarp Trivia Quiz, \u201cWho\u2019s Behind the Ice?\u201d challenge, a scavenger hunt, and a catch dart game, creating a lively and engaging atmosphere supported by an experienced MC and light entertainment.\n\nKey moments of the evening also included the recognition of valued customers through memento presentations, alongside the opportunity for select clients to share their experiences with IceWarp solutions, adding a personal and authentic dimension to the gathering.\n\nCommenting on the initiative, FIT General Manager Yoosoof Ihthisham said: \u201c\u2018The IceBreaker Moment\u2019 was designed to move beyond traditional formats and create a space where industry leaders could connect more openly. By fostering a relaxed and engaging environment, we aimed to build stronger relationships and create a more meaningful experience for our partners and customers.\u201d"
  },
